CM_ SG_ 1618 Timestamp "Time count of sample 1. Same unresolved raw tick timebase as TimestampSync; wraps modulo 65536 ticks.";
CM_ BO_ 1632 "Four chronological samples per axis/value and their sender-computed averages. Little-endian CAN-FD; raw timestamp/interval tick duration remains unresolved. Emit only four valid samples, do not substitute stale/invalid values. Each sensor modality has its own sampling interval; magnetometer batches need not align with IMU batches. Sensor saturation must be handled by firmware.";
CM_ SG_ 1632 AccelerationZAverage "Sender-populated arithmetic mean of AccelerationZ1..AccelerationZ4. Round to nearest wire step, exact ties away from zero in raw space. Codec does not compute this field.";
