CM_ BO_ 1648 "Four simultaneous physical linpot channels, plus their sender-computed arithmetic mean. Legacy 16-bit raw timestamp and 12-bit ADC calibration retained; all little-endian. The average extends the payload from 8 to 12 bytes. The four channels are not chronological samples.";
CM_ SG_ 1648 LinpotPositionAverage "Sender-populated arithmetic mean of LinpotPosition1..4 in mm. Same scale/offset as individual channels: average the four raw ADC counts, round to nearest raw count (half upward), then apply mm = raw * 0.0188885 + 1. Codec does not compute this field.";
